<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
<title>Reentry Job Portal: Santa Fe demo | Ron Dimon</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Public+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Source+Serif+4:opsz,wght@8..60,600;8..60,700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style is:global>
:root{
  --bg:#F6F3EE;--surface:#FFFFFF;--ink:#1E2A32;--muted:#5B6A74;--line:#DED7CC;--soft:#EFEAE2;
  --cand:#5B3FA8;--cand-ink:#47308A;--cand-soft:#EEE8FA;
  --sys:#0E7470;--sys-ink:#0A5A57;--sys-soft:#DFF2F0;
  --ok:#157347;--ok-soft:#E1F3E8;--warn:#8A5200;--warn-soft:#FBEBCB;--bad:#B42318;--bad-soft:#FBE4E1;
  --focus:#1D4ED8;
  --display:'Source Serif 4',Georgia,serif;--body:'Public Sans',system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;--mono:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root{
  --bg:#14181B;--surface:#1D2327;--ink:#E8EDF0;--muted:#9FB0BA;--line:#34404A;--soft:#252D33;
  --cand:#B7A2F2;--cand-ink:#CDBEF7;--cand-soft:#2B2543;
  --sys:#5CCFC8;--sys-ink:#8FE0DA;--sys-soft:#153533;
  --ok:#6BD39B;--ok-soft:#17321F;--warn:#F0B955;--warn-soft:#3B2C0E;--bad:#FF8A7D;--bad-soft:#3E1A16;--focus:#8AB4FF;color-scheme:dark}}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-padding-top:12px}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--body);font-size:15px;line-height:1.5}
button,input,select,textarea{font:inherit;color:inherit}
button{cursor:pointer}
a{color:var(--cand-ink)}
:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus);outline-offset:2px;border-radius:4px}
.skip{position:absolute;left:-999px;top:8px;background:var(--surface);padding:8px 12px;border-radius:6px;z-index:50}
.skip:focus{left:8px}
.wrap{max-width:1240px;margin-inline:auto;padding-inline:20px}

/* demo banner + header */
.demo{background:var(--warn-soft);color:var(--warn);border-bottom:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--warn) 30%,transparent);font-size:13.5px}
.demo .wrap{padding-block:10px;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start}
.demo b{letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:12px;background:var(--warn);color:var(--warn-soft);padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;flex:none;margin-top:1px}
.hd{padding-block:22px 8px}
.back{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}
.back:hover{color:var(--ink)}
h1{font-family:var(--display);font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3.6vw,2.5rem);line-height:1.1;margin:8px 0 6px;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.lede{margin:0;color:var(--muted);max-width:72ch}

/* tabs */
.tabs{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:18px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--line);overflow-x:auto}
.tab{background:none;border:0;border-bottom:4px solid transparent;margin-bottom:-2px;padding:12px 18px;font-weight:600;color:var(--muted);white-space:nowrap;min-height:48px}
.tab small{display:block;font-weight:400;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
.tab[aria-selected=true]{color:var(--ink);border-bottom-color:var(--cand)}
.tab:hover{color:var(--ink)}
.panel{padding-block:22px 40px}
.panel[hidden]{display:none}

/* generic */
.card{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:18px}
.h2{font-family:var(--display);font-size:1.35rem;margin:0 0 4px;line-height:1.2}
.h3{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 8px;font-weight:700}
.muted{color:var(--muted)}
.mono{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12.5px}
.btn{border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 16px;font-weight:600;min-height:44px}
.btn:hover{border-color:var(--ink)}
.btn.primary{background:var(--cand);border-color:var(--cand);color:#fff}
.btn.primary:hover{background:var(--cand-ink)}
.btn.sys{background:var(--sys);border-color:var(--sys);color:#fff}
.btn.sm{padding:6px 12px;min-height:36px;font-size:13.5px}
.btn.danger{color:var(--bad);border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--bad) 40%,var(--line))}
.btn[disabled]{opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed}
.chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;padding:2px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--soft);color:var(--muted);white-space:nowrap}
.chip.gov{background:var(--sys-soft);color:var(--sys-ink)}
.chip.sample{background:var(--warn-soft);color:var(--warn)}
.chip.ok{background:var(--ok-soft);color:var(--ok)}
.chip.warn{background:var(--warn-soft);color:var(--warn)}
.chip.bad{background:var(--bad-soft);color:var(--bad)}
.chip.cand{background:var(--cand-soft);color:var(--cand-ink)}
.chip.sys{background:var(--sys-soft);color:var(--sys-ink)}
.row{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
.spread{justify-content:space-between}
.grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}
.grid3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}
.scroll-x{overflow-x:auto}
svg.ic{width:1.05em;height:1.05em;vertical-align:-.15em;flex:none}

/* step bar */
.steps{display:flex;gap:8px;list-style:none;margin:0 0 14px;padding:0;overflow-x:auto}
.steps li{flex:1 0 auto}
.stepbtn{width:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:9px 12px;text-align:left;min-height:48px;white-space:nowrap}
.stepbtn .n{width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--soft);font-weight:700;font-size:13px;flex:none}
.stepbtn[aria-current=step]{border-color:var(--cand);background:var(--cand-soft)}
.stepbtn[aria-current=step] .n{background:var(--cand);color:#fff}
.stepbtn.done .n{background:var(--ok);color:#fff}
.stepbtn[disabled]{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}
.sysnote{display:flex;gap:12px;background:var(--sys-soft);color:var(--sys-ink);border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--sys) 30%,transparent);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:14px}
.sysnote .tag{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;background:var(--sys);color:#fff;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 7px;height:fit-content;flex:none;margin-top:2px}
.actionbar{position:sticky;bottom:0;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;margin-top:16px;padding:12px 14px;display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;box-shadow:0 -6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);z-index:5}

/* step 1: jobs */
.filters{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;margin-bottom:12px}
.pill{border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);border-radius:999px;padding:7px 14px;font-weight:600;font-size:13.5px;min-height:38px}
.pill[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--ink);color:var(--surface);border-color:var(--ink)}
.search{flex:1;min-width:180px;max-width:320px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:8px 14px;background:var(--surface);min-height:38px}
.jobs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}
.job{position:relative;display:flex;gap:12px;background:var(--surface);border:2px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:14px;cursor:pointer}
.job:hover{border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--cand) 50%,var(--line))}
.job input{position:absolute;opacity:0;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;cursor:pointer}
.job .box{width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:7px;border:2px solid var(--muted);display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none;margin-top:2px;background:var(--surface)}
.job .box svg{opacity:0;color:#fff;width:16px;height:16px}
.job:has(input:checked){border-color:var(--cand);background:var(--cand-soft)}
.job:has(input:checked) .box{background:var(--cand);border-color:var(--cand)}
.job:has(input:checked) .box svg{opacity:1}
.job:has(input:focus-visible){outline:3px solid var(--focus);outline-offset:2px}
.job .t{font-weight:700;font-size:16px;line-height:1.25}
.job .emp{color:var(--muted);font-size:13.5px}
.job .meta{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:8px}

/* step 2: skills */
.skgroup{margin-bottom:18px}
.skill{display:flex;gap:14px;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;margin-bottom:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.skill .l{font-weight:600;min-width:220px;flex:1}
.skill .for{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:3px}
.seg{display:inline-flex;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;flex:none}
.seg button{background:var(--surface);border:0;border-right:1px solid var(--line);padding:9px 14px;font-weight:600;font-size:13.5px;min-height:44px;color:var(--muted)}
.seg button:last-child{border-right:0}
.seg button[aria-pressed=true].have{background:var(--ok);color:#fff}
.seg button[aria-pressed=true].get{background:var(--warn);color:#fff}
.seg button[aria-pressed=true].no{background:var(--ink);color:var(--surface)}

/* step 3: fit */
.fit{margin-bottom:14px}
.fit .top{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap}
.meter{height:10px;background:var(--soft);border-radius:999px;overflow:hidden;min-width:140px}
.meter i{display:block;height:100%;border-radius:999px;background:var(--ok)}
.meter.mid i{background:var(--warn)}.meter.low i{background:var(--bad)}
.req{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;padding:7px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:14px}
.req:first-child{border-top:0}
.req .s{width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none;font-size:13px;margin-top:1px}
.req .s.have{background:var(--ok-soft);color:var(--ok)}
.req .s.get{background:var(--warn-soft);color:var(--warn)}
.req .s.gap{background:var(--bad-soft);color:var(--bad)}
.req .s.after{background:var(--soft);color:var(--muted)}
.req .note{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
.lvl{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.05em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
.help{background:var(--soft);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;font-size:13.5px;margin-top:10px}
.cond{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:10px}
.switch{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;min-height:44px}
.switch input{width:22px;height:22px;accent-color:var(--cand)}

/* step 4/5 */
.cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.2fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:16px}
.list{margin:0;padding-left:20px}.list li{margin-bottom:4px}
.no{color:var(--bad)}
.radio{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:8px;cursor:pointer;background:var(--surface)}
.radio input{margin-top:4px;width:18px;height:18px;accent-color:var(--cand)}
.radio:has(input:checked){border-color:var(--cand);background:var(--cand-soft)}
.consent{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;padding:14px;border:2px solid var(--cand);border-radius:12px;background:var(--cand-soft);cursor:pointer}
.consent input{width:24px;height:24px;margin-top:2px;accent-color:var(--cand);flex:none}
.tl{display:flex;gap:0;margin:12px 0 4px;align-items:flex-start}
.tl .st{flex:1;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);position:relative;padding-top:22px}
.tl .st::before{content:"";position:absolute;top:6px;left:0;right:0;height:3px;background:var(--line)}
.tl .st::after{content:"";position:absolute;top:0;left:50%;width:15px;height:15px;margin-left:-7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--surface);border:3px solid var(--line)}
.tl .st:first-child::before{left:50%}.tl .st:last-child::before{right:50%}
.tl .st.on{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
.tl .st.on::before{background:var(--cand)}
.tl .st.on::after{background:var(--cand);border-color:var(--cand)}
.tl .st.cur::after{box-shadow:0 0 0 4px color-mix(in srgb,var(--cand) 25%,transparent)}
.phone{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:22px;padding:14px;max-width:340px}
.bubble{background:var(--soft);border-radius:16px 16px 16px 4px;padding:10px 12px;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:14px}
.bubble time{display:block;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px}
.empty{border:2px dashed var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:22px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted)}

/* employers */
.emp-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 400px;gap:16px;align-items:start}
.openings{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(230px,1fr));gap:10px;margin-bottom:16px}
.opening{text-align:left;background:var(--surface);border:2px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px}
.opening[aria-pressed=true]{border-color:var(--sys);background:var(--sys-soft)}
.opening .t{font-weight:700}
.rank{display:grid;grid-template-columns:34px minmax(0,1.3fr) minmax(0,1.1fr) minmax(0,.9fr) 92px;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:12px 14px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);width:100%;background:none;border-left:0;border-right:0;border-bottom:0;text-align:left}
.rank:hover{background:var(--soft)}
.rank[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--sys-soft)}
.rank .no1{width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ink);color:var(--surface);display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:700;font-size:13px}
.rank .name{font-weight:700}
.rank .you{color:var(--cand-ink);font-size:12px;font-weight:700}
.rank .pct{font-family:var(--mono);font-weight:500}
.detail{position:sticky;top:12px}
.avatar{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--sys-soft);color:var(--sys-ink);display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:700;flex:none}
.decide{display:grid;gap:8px;margin-top:14px}
.note-box{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);background:var(--soft);padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:10px}

/* data */
.stat{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-direction:column}
.stat b{font-family:var(--display);font-size:1.9rem;line-height:1}
.bars{display:grid;gap:8px}
.bar{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(120px,210px) minmax(0,1fr) 54px;gap:10px;align-items:center;font-size:14px}
.bar .trk{height:22px;background:var(--soft);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}
.bar .trk i{display:block;height:100%;border-radius:6px}
.tbl{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px}
.tbl th{text-align:left;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);padding:8px 10px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--line);white-space:nowrap}
.tbl td{padding:9px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);vertical-align:top}
.tbl tr.sel td{background:var(--sys-soft)}
.tbl tbody tr[data-act]{cursor:pointer}.tbl tbody tr[data-act]:hover td{background:var(--soft)}
.src{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(250px,1fr));gap:12px}
.extract{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:14px}
.quote{border-left:4px solid var(--line);padding:2px 0 2px 12px;margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px}
.quote b{display:block;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:2px}
mark.hl{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--sys) 25%,transparent);color:inherit;padding:0 2px;border-radius:3px}
.prog{height:8px;background:var(--soft);border-radius:999px;overflow:hidden;margin-top:8px}.prog i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--sys);width:0;transition:width .5s}
.toast{position:fixed;left:50%;bottom:24px;transform:translateX(-50%);background:var(--ink);color:var(--surface);padding:12px 18px;border-radius:12px;font-weight:600;z-index:60;box-shadow:0 8px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.3);max-width:calc(100vw - 32px)}
.toast[hidden]{display:none}
details.dd{margin-top:28px}
details.dd summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:700;padding:12px 0}
.foot{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-block:24px 40px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

@media (max-width:980px){
  .emp-layout,.cols,.extract{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}
  .detail{position:static}
  .grid3{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}
}
@media (max-width:700px){
  .wrap{padding-inline:14px}
  .jobs,.grid2{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}
  .rank{grid-template-columns:30px minmax(0,1fr) 84px;gap:8px 10px}
  .rank .c3,.rank .c4{grid-column:2 / -1}
  .bar{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 54px}.bar .trk{grid-column:1 / -1;order:3}
  .seg{width:100%}.seg button{flex:1;padding-inline:6px}
  .stepbtn .lbl{display:none}.stepbtn[aria-current=step] .lbl{display:inline}
  .tab{padding:10px 4px;flex:1;text-align:center;font-size:14px}
  .tab small{display:none}
  .sysnote{flex-direction:column;gap:6px}
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{transition:none!important}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>

<div class="demo" role="note"><div class="wrap">
  <b>Demo</b>
  <span>Sample data only. City of Santa Fe roles, vacancy counts, requirements and re-entry fit tiers come from City HR files (vacancies as of Aug 14, 2026; 45 job descriptions, Oct 2026). Business postings and every applicant except the demo profile are made up; brand names are used only as realistic examples. Nothing here is saved or sent.</span>
</div></div>

<header class="wrap hd">
  <a class="back" href="/design">&larr; Design</a>
  <h1>Reentry Job Portal: Santa Fe demo</h1>
  <p class="lede">One place for a job seeker to pick jobs, check their skills against what each job asks for, and apply. One place for employers to review who applied. One place to see the data behind both.</p>
  <div class="tabs wrap" role="tablist" aria-label="Portal views" style="padding-inline:0">
    <button class="tab" role="tab" id="tab-applicants" aria-controls="panel-applicants" aria-selected="true" data-act="tab" data-v="applicants">Applicants<small>Find jobs, check fit, apply</small></button>
    <button class="tab" role="tab" id="tab-employers" aria-controls="panel-employers" aria-selected="false" data-act="tab" data-v="employers" tabindex="-1">Employers<small>Review and rank applicants</small></button>
    <button class="tab" role="tab" id="tab-data" aria-controls="panel-data" aria-selected="false" data-act="tab" data-v="data" tabindex="-1">Data<small>Openings, requirements, skills</small></button>
  </div>
</header>

<main id="main" class="wrap">
  <section class="panel" id="panel-applicants" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-applicants"></section>
  <section class="panel" id="panel-employers" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-employers" hidden></section>
  <section class="panel" id="panel-data" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-data" hidden></section>

  <details class="dd card">
    <summary>Design choices behind this demo</summary>
    <ol class="list">
      <li><b>Jobs first, then skills.</b> The skills checklist is built from the descriptions of the jobs the person picked, so it can only exist after they choose.</li>
      <li><b>The fit check advises; it never blocks.</b> "You meet 3 of 4" helps someone focus. Many entry-level "requirements" are really preferences, so the person can always apply anyway.</li>
      <li><b>"One-shot" depends on the employer.</b> The demo shows three routes: a direct connection (City pilot), an application packet emailed to a named contact, and a pre-filled hand-off to the employer's own site.</li>
      <li><b>Status is the hard part.</b> Most employers will not report back on their own. The demo mixes employer decisions, a named contact, and the applicant reporting their own progress.</li>
      <li><b>Records stay out.</b> The portal does not collect conviction history, Social Security numbers or medical details. Postings that state a background check are flagged so a navigator can talk it through first.</li>
      <li><b>Built for phones and shared devices.</b> Text-message updates, big tap targets, and a navigator who can see status with the applicant's consent.</li>
    </ol>
  </details>
</main>

<footer class="wrap foot">
  A working demo by Ron Dimon. City data: City of Santa Fe Human Resources. Business postings and applicants are fictional. <a href="/design">Back to Design</a>
</footer>

